490785522051_7060671143405339728_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4DY_rTtYb1IQ7kNvwEEslEX&_nc_oc=AdnqrZPOfJYM4UyzaO-IckO9nwm1c2W1i2q61EmZaSeaxOO7N5xLIViq1jGPJlM0X_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzE_2MXZS7Zbsg7v3Eiak2IuLVEbuGSwLxAX4s-lJRWjQ&oe=69B95AB2"}, {"file_name": "landscape_4.png", "id": "5564456170299960", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65402515_5564456173633293_8166203934336264507_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dkAKboWh-_oQ7kNvwEODYFv&_nc_oc=Adm0XiJEkCYr3AaR6TvY__MvdBxEhKIkn2tG0Wj_UEV-iDnIT2PFtZyGXPBq4-hs7N0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy05i05e1nA2jso02N00EBABLF1Oq2vPMVwb2qCc9on1w&oe=69B93B76"}, {"file_name": "landscape_5.png", "id": "634797031492068", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001717_634797034825401_6944852042907467801_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gL6RIRMCFRcQ7kNvwH4Dg_l&_nc_oc=AdlJuZQsdyUYbacsUkF3Q_ezF1jPM7m--p9djHEdd0w_TZpAAyNNAWCyIvWeayXLrII&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxWvD6K7PVHkvVuGwW-zZiOwvnEt4bjvMHnCj9Ctyv5rw&oe=69B9596B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Notre-Dame de Paris: Voyage dans le Pass\u00e9", "keywords": ["NotreDameDeParis", "NotreDame", "Paris"], "long_description": "(Re)-d\u00e9couvrez Notre-Dame de Paris telle qu\u2019elle \u00e9tait il y a 2 si\u00e8cles, pendant la R\u00e9volution Fran\u00e7aise. Au c\u0153ur du jeu vid\u00e9o Assassin\u2019s Creed : Unity, la reconstitution 3D de la cath\u00e9drale a n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 5000 heures de travail graphique, guid\u00e9 par des historiens.\nDe la nef \u00e0 la fl\u00e8che, admirez chaque perspective du monument, et finissez par un spectaculaire voyage en ballon au-dessus des arches, et de Paris \u00e0 la fin du XVIII\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Le tout au son d\u2019une fantaisie de Bach jou\u00e9e sur le c\u00e9l\u00e8bre orgue Cavaill\u0